text: |-
  Under Utah law (Section 77-7-1), an
  arrest is defined as the actual restraint
  or submission to custody, constituting
  a detention, which does not
  automatically mean formal charges
  have been filed. It is a temporary
  holding for investigation or booking,
  distinct from the final, formal
  prosecution by a
  prosecutor.
  Utah Education Net... +3
